@startuml
!include style.puml
skinparam ArrowFontStyle plain

box Logic LOGIC_COLOR_T1
participant ":LogicManager" as Logic LOGIC_COLOR
participant ":AddressBookParser" as Parser LOGIC_COLOR
participant ":MarkCommandParser" as MarkParser LOGIC_COLOR
participant "m:MarkCommand" as Command LOGIC_COLOR
end box
box Model MODEL_COLOR_T1
participant "live:Model" as Live MODEL_COLOR
participant "pending:ModelManager" as Pending MODEL_COLOR
participant "student:Person" as Student MODEL_COLOR
end box
participant ":Storage" as Storage STORAGE_COLOR

[-> Logic : execute("mark i/A0123456B d/2026-10-20 l/Tutorial 1")
activate Logic
Logic -> Parser : parseCommand(commandText)
activate Parser
create MarkParser
Parser -> MarkParser : new MarkCommandParser()
Parser -> MarkParser : parse(arguments)
activate MarkParser
note right of MarkParser
Validate i/, d/, l/ and parse values with ParserUtil.
Invalid input throws ParseException before execution.
end note
create Command
MarkParser -> Command : new MarkCommand(studentId, date, group)
MarkParser --> Parser : m
deactivate MarkParser
destroy MarkParser
Parser --> Logic : m
deactivate Parser
Logic -> Command : isModifyingData()
Command --> Logic : true
note over Logic
Continue only if startup loading succeeded.
end note
Logic -> Live : getAddressBook(), getUserPrefs(), getFilteredPersonListPredicate()
Live --> Logic : records, preferences, filter
create Pending
Logic -> Pending : new ModelManager(records, preferences)
Logic -> Pending : updateFilteredPersonList(filter)
Logic -> Command : execute(pending)
activate Command
Command -> Pending : getAddressBook().getPersonList()
Pending --> Command : complete student list
note over Command, Student
Find student by ID, including hidden students.
If absent, throw CommandException without saving.
end note
Command -> Student : getLabels()
Student --> Command : labels
note over Command, Student
Match current group label ignoring case.
If absent, throw CommandException without saving.
end note
Command -> Student : getAttendance()
Student --> Command : attendance
note over Command, Student
Reject an existing entry for the date and group.
Copy the set and add AttendanceRecord(date, matchedGroup).
Build updatedStudent retaining all other fields.
end note
Command -> Pending : setPerson(student, updatedStudent)
Command --> Logic : result: "Marked student A0123456B present for Tutorial 1 on 2026-10-20."
deactivate Command
Logic -> Storage : saveAddressBook(pending.getAddressBook())
activate Storage
note right of Storage
Lock, write temporary JSON, check external changes,
then replace atomically.
end note
alt save succeeds
Storage --> Logic : saved
Logic -> Logic : recordUndoSnapshot(previousAddressBook, pending records)
Logic -> Live : setAddressBook(pending.getAddressBook())
Logic -> Live : updateFilteredPersonList(pending filter)
[<-- Logic : result
else save fails
Storage --> Logic : IOException (save error)
note over Live
Live records and filter remain unchanged.
The previous saved file is preserved.
end note
[<-- Logic : CommandException (save error)
end
deactivate Storage
note over Logic
Capture previousAddressBook before command execution.
Retain it after saving only if records changed (maximum 100 snapshots).
On success, refresh an open attendance report for its existing
date and group; attach it to the result.
On failure, preserve undo history and the displayed report.
Map external changes, another writer, storage location,
and general I/O failures to their respective error messages.
end note
deactivate Logic
@enduml
